OL,3,AIndian jewellery ad pulled after
OL,4,Abacklash over actor's outfit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Indian jewellery brand has removed
OL,7,Ftheir new advertisement for the
OL,8,Fupcoming festival of Rakshabandhan,
OL,9,Falso known as Rakhi, after backlash
OL,10,Fover the outfit worn by the female
OL,11,Flead.
OL,13,FThe ad featured popular Bollywood actor
OL,14,FKriti Sanon celebrating the Hindu
OL,15,Ffestival in which sisters tie a thread
OL,16,Fcalled Rakhi over their brothers'
OL,17,Fwrists.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
