OL,3,AIndian jewellery ad pulled after
OL,4,Abacklash over actor's outfit
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanon, who is seen in a cropped top,
OL,7,Fskirt and a cape, addressed her critics
OL,8,Fon Tuesday night saying "culture and
OL,9,Ftraditions are in a woman's heart, not
OL,10,Fin her neckline!"
OL,12,FThe row started earlier on Tuesday
OL,13,Fafter actor and BJP MP Kangana Ranaut
OL,14,Fcalled the ad "intentionally creepy"
OL,15,Fand asked why someone would tie a Rakhi
OL,16,Fdressed in a bikini.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
